ord here runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids October to November came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 32% of normal in July to August and 48% of normal in August to September. Every grid had its driest year in 1963, and grid 19364 got just 58% of normal that year.</p>"}
